Bu sequencing arayacağız kısmı aslında şu ifadelerde önemli.

1103
02:19:58,355 --> 02:20:04,115
We normally use these words at the beginning of the sentence to give a summary of what we have said or written.

1104
02:20:04,935 --> 02:20:06,796
Sequencing arayacağız, the former, the latter.

1105
